parry a hit, they didn't fightback because the attacker is set by hit_player() in living.c and you weren'tcalling that. Hence I changed it fromreturn 0;toreturn me->hit_player(0, kind, elem);so that the required functionality was calling in living.c and there is stillno damage.Just letting you know.Sauron**gareth**To: emeraldSubj: help with guildCc: garethDate: Feb 16Heya Alison how are ya doin' ?I'm okie. just looking for a job and chilling out fora bit going for interviews.I was wondering if you could do me a favor? could you possibly code a few things for my guild till i get settled down?it woiould only be for about 1 month or so.thanksCarlos**balan**To: garethSubj: guild powersDate: Feb 24death blow - kills things  automatically when thjy have are barely aliveweapon smash - as the name impliesknockout/stun - which will deprive anenemy of an attack                for a short period of timethese are some of the new skills i want to put in**sauron**To: garethSubj: berzerkDate: Mar  5I've done some work on the soul and have moved berzerk/calm out to separatefiles. Everything is in /p/g/guild/sauron/ - they all load, but I haven'ttested them any further. I also moved the fighter chat line to a separatefile.Let me know what you think.Sauron**exos**To: garethSubj: fighter guildDate: Mar 20Hey man.Just wanted to offer my help if you need some help with fighter guild.Just ask anything you might need.Later**exos**To: garethSubj: berzerk_shadDate: Mar 30Ok a few points....First off....if you call hit_player, then everytime damage is dealt to fighter.they will strike out 1-3 times at that target.Not too bad, but I have monsters that hit everytime a player hits....so we have aninfinite loop here.Probably need to base it on attack().So iffighter attacks once, he will tack on 1-3 more attacks.I'll approach from this angle.One thing....if a fighter is berzerk using your current shadow, they NEVER take damage.because they never receive hit_player damage!More on this later.**akira**To: garethSubj: hiDate: Mar 30I was reading your fighters board the other day and I saw that giantscan not bash. Well the way I look at it (keep in mind I am a barbarian)is why hide behind a shield when you hit someone? Do it the barbarianway just body block the punk and knock them on there ass! You wouldhave to be very strong to do this but giants are and it is a real nobrainer. It takes no skill to run at someone and hit them with yourbody. Give it some thought.					Akira/Khanp.s. make it so barbarians can wield frostbite sword william has :)**akira**To: garethSubj: ideaDate: Apr  3Well you could at least mail me back and tell me what you thoughtof my idea. And then make it so barbarians can use the frostbitesword. We need all the help we can get. And while your at it ifyou could find us a new GM that would be nice.					Akira/Khan**texas**To: garethSubj: emails addressesDate: Apr 23ok these are my email addresses in order of prefernece :john@greebo.snarc.comdarke@mailexcite.comTexas@lineone.netTex**salesman**To: garethSubj: WizzingDate: May 16Dear Sensei,It will take a li'l more time to start exam... Call me JudasWhy ? coz I sold my soul for forty (or more) silver coins :)Changed jobs today, less work and in time, double pay !Not too bad ?Anyway, 1st break is scheduled 17 june, if my current boss lets me gosooner then i'll do the best I can.. new job starts June,2nd.Sayonara ?Olaf.**izekiel**To: exosSubj: mentoringCc: sauron, gareth, warlordDate: Jul  8hi-  this may seem a tad forward... but i am looking for a mentor. i'd like toadvance to wizard as i feel i can contribute to the bettering of the mud...unlike some of your supposedly competent current wizzes. =)You guys have impressed me most.... i feel that i cannot go wrong with whomever will sponsor me. hopefully, one of you w